<title>POLAND: ELEKTROBUDOWA TO ISSUE PLN 20 MLN CPS.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROBUDOWA TO ISSUE PLN 20 MLN CPS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Elektrobudowa SA and Polish Development Bank (PBR) have signed a contract for the builder to issue commercial paper worth up to 20 million zlotys, Elektrobudowa said.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement on Friday that the proceeds would go toward funding current operations but gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
